# BTA Plugin Configuration
# ========================
# List plugins to disable (one per line).
# Lines starting with '#' are comments (ignored).
# Empty lines are also ignored.
#
# Usage:
#   Simply add the plugin filename below to disable it at startup.
#   You can use either format:
#     test_plugin.sh
#     disable: test_plugin.sh
#
# Example:
#   test_plugin.sh
#
# To re-enable a plugin, remove or comment out its line.
# If this file does not exist, all plugins are enabled.
